{"path":".agents/skills/vitadeck-vdapp-upload/SKILL.md","ref":"9d671384dbb819d16682adc129c7e1e2ea8547a5","side":"new","lines":[{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":1,"text":"---"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":2,"text":"name: vitadeck-vdapp-upload"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":3,"text":"description: Uploads a Deck App Runtime Upload Archive (.vdapp.zip) to a Vita running VitaDeck over LAN. Use when the user asks to upload, publish, or deploy a vdapp to Vita/PSVita, push a deck app to hardware, or curl a .vdapp.zip to the Runtime Upload listener."},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":4,"text":"---"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":5,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":6,"text":"# VitaDeck vdapp upload"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":7,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":8,"text":"## Prerequisite"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":9,"text":""},{"sha":"c7e17ffcf6337f1dc70ce7828c3f521901430ead","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868290,"line":10,"text":"VitaDeck must be running on the Vita with **Runtime Upload** active (Shell → **Upload** → confirm). The listener serves `POST /upload` on port **8787** (falls forward through 8796 if busy; the Shell Upload Screen shows the bound port, pass it with `--port`)."},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":11,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":12,"text":"## Quick start"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":13,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":14,"text":"From any directory, upload a built archive:"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":15,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":16,"text":"```sh"},{"sha":"c7e17ffcf6337f1dc70ce7828c3f521901430ead","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1792868290,"line":17,"text":"/path/to/vitadeck/.agents/skills/vitadeck-vdapp-upload/scripts/upload-vdapp.sh /path/to/myapp.vdapp.zip"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":18,"text":"```"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":19,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":20,"text":"Success looks like: `{\"ok\":true,\"packageName\":\"myapp.vdapp\",\"version\":\"0.1.0\"}`"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":21,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":22,"text":"## Build the archive (if needed)"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":23,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":24,"text":"Inside a Deck App project (this repo or elsewhere):"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":25,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":26,"text":"```sh"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":27,"text":"vitadeck build"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":28,"text":"```"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":29,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":30,"text":"Produces `<outDir>/<name>.vdapp/` and `<outDir>/<name>.vdapp.zip` (e.g. `dist/chat.vdapp.zip`). Use the **`.zip`**, not the unpacked folder."},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":31,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":32,"text":"## Vita IP"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":33,"text":""},{"sha":"0b42e8b54b2ea973134ef93526a061c83f3bd4ff","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792932736,"line":34,"text":"Pass `--ip`, or set `PSVITAIP` (the same variable the Vita `upload_vita` / `upload_vpk` CMake targets read):"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":35,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":36,"text":"```sh"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":37,"text":"upload-vdapp.sh --ip 192.168.1.50 myapp.vdapp.zip"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":38,"text":"# or"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":39,"text":"PSVITAIP=192.168.1.50 upload-vdapp.sh myapp.vdapp.zip"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":40,"text":"```"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":41,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":42,"text":"## Manual curl"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":43,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":44,"text":"```sh"},{"sha":"0b42e8b54b2ea973134ef93526a061c83f3bd4ff","author":"Máté Molnár","timestamp":1792932736,"line":45,"text":"curl -X POST \"http://${PSVITAIP}:8787/upload\" \\"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":46,"text":"  -F archive=@/path/to/myapp.vdapp.zip"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":47,"text":"```"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":48,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":49,"text":"## Troubleshooting"},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":50,"text":""},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":51,"text":"- **Connection refused** — Upload screen not open on Vita, or wrong IP."},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":52,"text":"- **409** — Another upload in progress; wait and retry."},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":53,"text":"- **422** — Bad archive layout; zip must contain exactly one top-level `*.vdapp` directory."},{"sha":"13303a1cccf9c90454314c3679f9b5ffd5552252","author":"matemolnar8","timestamp":1781442047,"line":54,"text":"- After upload, pick the package on **Shell Home Screen** (Enter) if it did not become active automatically."}]}
